WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.350
Hi. You know, one of the great things
about LingQ is our community. Language

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:08.730
learners from all over the world. I've
already mentioned to you that you can

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:12.900
have your writing corrected on the
Exchange by our members. You can have

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:18.539
online discussions with native speakers.
You yourself can also help others in the

00:00:18.539 --> 00:00:22.590
same way. You will have noticed that the
lessons in our library have been

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:26.820
contributed by our members. You can do
the same; you can perhaps record a

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:32.340
conversation with your friend or your
spouse and have it transcribed. You can

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:36.390
maybe indicate on our forum some of the
resources that exist for the language

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:42.809
that you're learning. On our forum, people
often offer answers to questions that

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:47.129
learners have about their native
language. There are so many different

00:00:47.129 --> 00:00:52.079
ways that you can help others, and that
others can help you. Try to familiarize

00:00:52.079 --> 00:00:56.579
yourself with these or ask questions on
our forum, and you will see that it's a

00:00:56.579 --> 00:01:03.260
very supportive community that will help
you achieve your language learning goals.

